  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-AM6-1 (important): dependency-allowlist enforcement code (the same underlying gap previously tracked as the deferred AM2-BOUNDARY-DEPENDENCY-UNDOCUMENTED backlog item, i.e. lint_boundaries.py's collect_manifest_dependency_allowlist_violations() never wired into run()/main()) remains dead/unwired from just lint's actual entrypoint. AM.6 is the phase's minimality/closure gate, so this backlog item should be resolved now rather than deferred again: either wire the function into the real lint entrypoint with a representative mutation test, or delete it if it is genuinely superseded by another enforcement path." ;
