  triage:closureNote "Fixed @ 42e26395: collect_manifest_dependency_allowlist_violations(repo_root, records) is now called directly from lint_boundaries.py's run() (the real just-lint entrypoint), with an end-to-end regression test (test_run_rejects_manifest_dependency_not_allowlisted) exercising run() itself. Independently confirmed by req-qa, arch-qa, and rust-qa (which ran python3 .just/lint_boundaries.py directly and confirmed 'boundaries passed' plus the full 26-check just lint suite green)." ;
